UID:a66d5462656d2436@theblockpetaluma.com
DESCRIPTION:Callie Watts is a dynamic and versatile vocalist known for her
  soulful voice\, magnetic stage presence\, and genre-spanning repertoire. 
 With a foundation rooted in jazz\, blues\, and classic soul\, Callie seaml
 essly blends contemporary influences with timeless sounds to create perfor
 mances that resonate with diverse audiences.
LOCATION:The Block Petaluma
URL:calliewatts.com
X-SOURCE:The Block Petaluma
END:VEVENT
